ục tối đa lên đến 24h (tuỳ cường độ) .\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTHÔNG SỐ KĨ THUẬT:\u003cbr /\u003e• Kích thước: 284 x 39 x 48 mm\u003cbr /\u003e• Khối lượng: 184g\u003cbr /\u003e• Chất liệu: Nhựa ABS và PC\u003cbr /\u003e• Công suất: 5W\u003cbr /\u003e• Dạng bóng: LED\u003cbr /\u003e• Pin: 1800mAh\u003cbr /\u003e• Nhiệt độ màu: 3000K - 5000K\u003cbr /\u003e• Thời lượng sử dụng: 4 giờ liên tục ở độ sáng cao nhất và 24h liên tục cho độ sáng thấp nhất\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHÌNH ẢNH SẢN PHẨM:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/49/bf/2a/bfd53b6a08249c4392ef543bd2cd2277.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/49/bf/2a/bfd53b6a08249c4392ef543bd2cd2277.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1377\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e2/ac/f4/ebe19222ed1e420a9aac1aed96508da4.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e2/ac/f4/ebe19222ed1e420a9aac1aed96508da4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"812\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/97/3a/b9/f371d3b4f925c1350bc3e948eb3efd94.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/97/3a/b9/f371d3b4f925c1350bc3e948eb3efd94.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1221\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e2/32/a2/1cb69ab86fbc261ad7a5b0eb5369c76e.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e2/32/a2/1cb69ab86fbc261ad7a5b0eb5369c76e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1624\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/1b/17/c4/a3b753de1ba67fa959e5872519e433e3.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/1b/17/c4/a3b753de1ba67fa959e5872519e433e3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1121\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/29/7f/e7/86c6c19c0e98ac914f6b19db8e839bc6.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.co